    {
      "subId": "7503602",
      "subQuestName": "查看龙伙伴的发现",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750360201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750360201": {
            "id": "750360201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，怎么了，刚刚看你刨啊刨的，挖出了什么了不起的东西吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360202"
            ]
          },
          "750360202": {
            "id": "750360202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，难道挖到了什么值钱的宝藏？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360203"
            ]
          },
          "750360203": {
            "id": "750360203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360204"
            ]
          },
          "750360204": {
            "id": "750360204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…我来看看，这个看上去好像是什么东西的种子…没想到在这个看上去像是荒地的地方，还能挖出这样的东西呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360205"
            ]
          },
          "750360205": {
            "id": "750360205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360206"
            ]
          },
          "750360206": {
            "id": "750360206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，这个看上去应该不是特别值钱…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360207"
            ]
          },
          "750360207": {
            "id": "750360207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360210"
            ]
          },
          "750360210": {
            "id": "750360210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过，怎么看都是已经荒废了的地方…土看上去都硬硬的，这个种子真的还活着吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360211"
            ]
          },
          "750360211": {
            "id": "750360211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔…嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360212"
            ]
          },
          "750360212": {
            "id": "750360212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你是在难过吗…不过这个很难说啦，毕竟有些种子天生就没有办法发芽…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360213"
            ]
          },
          "750360213": {
            "id": "750360213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过具体如何，我们就再种下去看看吧，也许它到现在还没发芽，只是因为挖的坑不好，也没有足够的营养。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360214"
            ]
          },
          "750360214": {
            "id": "750360214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我们再好好种下去，说不定它就能长出来呢！嘿嘿，会长出什么呢，超大的颗粒果，嗯…特别特别香的苦种也不错！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360215"
            ]
          },
          "750360215": {
            "id": "750360215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360216"
            ]
          },
          "750360216": {
            "id": "750360216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "也许会长出骗骗花…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360217"
            ]
          },
          "750360217": {
            "id": "750360217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这种时候就不要扫兴啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750360218"
            ]
          },
          "750360218": {
            "id": "750360218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过纳塔的植物会需要什么营养呢…不管了，先种下去再说吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
